It's a mousy!

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:31.440
...of Gelfling's absence.

01:09:32.840 --> 01:09:36.180
Get ready to fight!

01:09:38.920 --> 01:09:39.500
Fight!

01:09:46.050 --> 01:09:47.570
Gelfling, call the prisoners!

01:09:48.150 --> 01:09:49.240
You have the gift!

01:09:49.520 --> 01:09:51.240
Call them to freedom, now!

01:09:55.630 --> 01:09:55.930
Shut up!

01:10:03.420 --> 01:10:17.420
Shut up all of you!

01:10:17.670 --> 01:10:21.900
Get out of here!

01:10:22.690 --> 01:10:24.570
Gelfling, free them!

01:10:36.720 --> 01:10:38.920
Take this! Take this!

01:10:51.590 --> 01:10:52.710
I'm going to kill you!

01:11:35.470 --> 01:11:38.010
Nedy! Nedy! Nedy! Nedy!

01:11:44.490 --> 01:11:54.070
Too late, Gelfling! You arrived too late!

01:11:54.310 --> 01:11:55.770
The great conjunction has begun!

01:11:56.170 --> 01:11:59.160
Now the Skeksis will also have the power over the stars!

01:12:01.440 --> 01:12:02.840
When will the conjunction be?

01:12:03.330 --> 01:12:05.490
Very soon the three suns will be united.

01:12:06.730 --> 01:12:07.290
Jen...

01:12:07.290 --> 01:12:11.020
Ah Gelfling!

01:12:11.160 --> 01:12:12.480
I fear for you,

01:12:12.560 --> 01:12:13.960
the encounter with death.

01:12:31.850 --> 01:12:33.130
Stay down, Fizzgeek! Shut up!

01:12:33.270 --> 01:12:40.170
Yeah, you really are helping me.

01:12:52.520 --> 01:12:52.920
No...

01:12:52.920 --> 01:12:57.330
And now where am I?

01:12:58.380 --> 01:12:58.780
Fizzgeek!

01:13:07.160 --> 01:13:07.840
I got it.

01:13:30.280 --> 01:13:30.520
Thank you.

01:14:02.972 --> 01:14:03.972
But that's the crystal!

01:14:37.960 --> 01:14:39.690
Pug, you're alive!

01:14:39.910 --> 01:14:41.950
There is no time, there is no time!

01:14:42.110 --> 01:14:44.740
When the triple sun will shine individually...

01:14:45.060 --> 01:14:45.660
Where is Kira?

01:14:45.800 --> 01:14:53.680
Big conjunction, coming!

01:15:59.084 --> 01:15:59.584
Done.

01:17:09.690 --> 01:17:25.370
That's why I came, the black crystal, three in one fragment.

01:18:37.710 --> 01:18:38.010
Kira!

01:18:38.990 --> 01:18:39.250
Jen!

01:18:39.610 --> 01:18:53.200
The Great Conjunction is coming!

01:18:53.540 --> 01:18:57.220
Now we will live forever!

01:18:57.640 --> 01:18:59.820
We will live...

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:00.340
IN ETERN

01:19:00.340 --> 01:19:01.040
NO!

01:19:14.060 --> 01:19:15.020
GO AWAY!

01:19:20.480 --> 01:19:20.600
AHH!

01:19:22.050 --> 01:19:22.530
GALFLIN!

01:19:22.790 --> 01:19:23.530
GALFLIN HERE!

01:19:23.650 --> 01:19:24.390
IN THE HOUSE!

01:19:24.530 --> 01:19:25.070
SHUT IT!

01:19:25.390 --> 01:19:26.110
STOP IT!

01:19:26.410 --> 01:19:26.890
BEGIN!

01:19:27.650 --> 01:19:29.610
OH NO!

01:19:31.150 --> 01:19:32.410
It's dangerous, it must die!

01:19:33.910 --> 01:19:36.660
It will destroy us! The Gelfling will destroy us!

01:19:38.240 --> 01:19:39.080
Take it!

01:19:39.400 --> 01:19:40.400
It will die!

01:19:41.900 --> 01:19:45.090
Another one! Another Gelfling!

01:19:46.740 --> 01:19:48.880
Another one! Another Gelfling!

01:19:49.120 --> 01:19:49.840
Take it!

01:19:50.000 --> 01:19:50.580
The prophecy!

01:19:53.480 --> 01:19:54.120
Gartim!

01:19:55.360 --> 01:19:56.000
Gartim!

01:19:56.180 --> 01:19:56.820
Gartim!

01:19:56.940 --> 01:19:58.140
Take it!

01:19:58.640 --> 01:19:59.700
Gartim, take it!

01:20:01.280 --> 01:20:01.940
Don't let him get away!

01:20:07.740 --> 01:20:16.750
The fragment!

01:20:32.810 --> 01:20:39.920
The Geltring!

01:20:39.920 --> 01:20:40.660
The Geltring!

01:20:40.720 --> 01:20:41.380
The fragment!

01:20:41.800 --> 01:20:42.840
The Geltring!

01:20:44.000 --> 01:20:45.920
Take the fragment now!

01:20:45.960 --> 01:20:46.380
Now!

01:20:47.590 --> 01:20:48.390
Watch out, Akira!

01:20:49.050 --> 01:20:52.260
Give me the fragment!

01:20:52.780 --> 01:20:53.060
No!

01:20:53.780 --> 01:20:54.420
Akira!

01:20:54.640 --> 01:20:55.440
Behind you!

01:20:55.680 --> 01:20:56.260
No!

01:20:58.730 --> 01:20:59.350
Let her be!

01:21:00.320 --> 01:21:01.900
Show me the fragment and I'll be free!

01:21:02.600 --> 01:21:03.160
No!

01:21:03.640 --> 01:21:04.200
Yes!

01:21:04.500 --> 01:21:05.760
You must not hurt her!

01:21:06.680 --> 01:21:07.700
No, Jen!

01:21:07.960 --> 01:21:10.180
The crystal is vanishing!

01:21:10.180 --> 01:21:10.620
Turn!

01:21:37.980 --> 01:21:50.360
The prophecy!

01:21:50.940 --> 01:21:52.980
No, no, no, no, no, no!

01:21:53.300 --> 01:21:53.980
The prophecy!

01:21:54.700 --> 01:21:56.440
No, no, no, no, no!

01:21:56.770 --> 01:21:57.290
No!

01:22:15.484 --> 01:22:17.484
let's go

01:22:20.188 --> 01:22:22.188
Prophecy! Prophecy!

01:23:00.924 --> 01:23:01.264
No, no.

01:23:32.400 --> 01:23:33.780
How are you done out there?

01:23:33.900 --> 01:23:39.730
Come on, up!

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:59.980
Thanks for watching!

01:25:23.260 --> 01:25:26.010
All is done, again it will be complete.

01:25:26.270 --> 01:25:28.380
The two will become one.

01:25:41.000 --> 01:25:43.490
The prophecy is fulfilled.

01:25:46.210 --> 01:25:47.430
Now we are again.

01:26:06.172 --> 01:26:07.772
A long time ago...

01:26:08.284 --> 01:26:11.444
in our arrogance and disappointment.

01:26:12.572 --> 01:26:15.852
We have broken the pure crystal.

01:26:16.252 --> 01:26:19.132
and our world is broken.

01:26:21.052 --> 01:26:23.812
for your courage and your sacrifice.

01:26:24.412 --> 01:26:26.412
They made us whole.

01:26:27.420 --> 01:26:29.980
and they have restored the true

01:26:30.000 --> 01:26:32.000
the power of the crystal

01:26:35.340 --> 01:26:37.340
Keep it tight.

01:26:38.604 --> 01:26:40.604
She is part of you.

01:26:41.100 --> 01:26:44.980
Like all of us, we are all part of each other.

01:27:11.610 --> 01:27:20.980
we leave you the crystal of truth, create your world in its light
